  "prompt_scope": "Counts only text inserted into the next model prompt. Receipts and evidence stay outside the prompt and are reported separately as stored bytes.",
  "quality_scope": "Disposition correctness on nine declared policy fixtures, not general model-output quality.",
  "retention_policy": "The complete receipt chain is retained locally; the prompt projection includes only the latest 3 accepted action-and-fact items.",
